8. `IF cart velocity < -4 THEN move right(2)` to adjust for high negative velocities sooner.
9. `IF Pole angle > 0 THEN move right(2)` as a default action when the pole is leaning to the right.
10. `IF Pole angle < 0 THEN move left(1)` as a default action when the pole is leaning to the left.

This updated strategy aims to improve upon my previous best by introducing more nuanced controls for cart velocity and ensuring that actions are taken based on a comprehensive understanding of both the pole's and the cart's states.
