   - IF Pole angle < 0 AND Pole angular velocity < 0 THEN move left (1).
   - IF abs(Pole angle) > 10 AND Pole angular velocity > 0 THEN move right (2).
   - IF abs(Pole angle) > 10 AND Pole angular velocity < 0 THEN move left (1).

